    "standardized_narrative": "Argenta Syndicate 2121 experienced an overall gross strengthening of GBP 1.776 million on prior years' provisions in 2015. This was driven by a GBP 3.356 million deterioration in the Fire and other damage to property line of business, partially offset by favourable development of GBP 1.275 million in Marine, aviation and transport and GBP 0.344 million in reinsurance acceptances. Separately, reserves for 2012 and prior years showed a favourable development, generating a surplus of GBP 6.1 million. However, the 2013 year of account saw adverse claims development in the primary marine employers' liability class. The 2014 year of account was impacted by larger losses such as the Guam Power loss, Australian hailstorms, and the Quilliq Energy fire loss, which developed in 2015.",
    "raw_causal_phrases": [
      "An overall deterioration of GBP 1,776,000 on prior years' provisions was experienced during the year.",
